  "id": "che",
  "term": "ChE",
  "definition": "ChE, in this packet, refers to cultural heritage education: educational experiences about cultural heritage that are intended to help students internalize its meaning and value. In the study, it is described as promoting civic engagement partly by strengthening cultural identity and cultural pride.",
